// IntroString :
"P864244696" "I have received information that a heist is being planned in Talos Island. <a href={ACCEPT}>I need your help in thwarting this attack!</a> The villains should arrive 20 minutes after your arrival. Stop them at any cost!<br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. You can earn extra time by defeating villains, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P494819743" "Protect Talos Island bank"
// SendOffString :
